{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"Breathing","html":"<article id='sn46.66'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Saṁyutta Nikāya 46.66 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Linked Discourses 46.66 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>7. Ānāpānavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>7. Breathing </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>Ānāpānasutta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Breathing </span></h1></header>\n<p><span class='root'>“Ānāpānassati, bhikkhave, bhāvitā …pe…” </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>“Mendicants, when mindfulness of breathing is developed and cultivated it’s very fruitful and beneficial. …” </span>\n<span class='root'>dasamaṁ. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p>\n<p class='endvagga'><span class='root'>Ānāpānavaggo sattamo. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p>\n<p class='uddana-intro'><span class='root'>Tassuddānaṁ </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p>\n<blockquote class='uddanagatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Aṭṭhikapuḷavakaṁ vinīlakaṁ, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Vicchiddakaṁ uddhumātena pañcamaṁ; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Mettā karuṇā muditā, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Upekkhā ānāpānena te dasāti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span></p></blockquote></article>"}
